# Frontend Conventions

Follow `.ai/architecture/frontend.md`.

## State

- Server state → TanStack Query
- UI state → Zustand or local state
- Forms → React Hook Form + Zod
- Do not mirror API cache into Zustand

## Surfaces

- `(student)` portal: dashboard, PDF reader, submissions, grades, offline cache
- `(instructor)` panel: review + grading
- `(admin)` dashboard: users, courses, drip, gradebook/export

## UX constraints

- Built-in PDF viewer for modules
- Low-data friendly payloads and lazy-loaded heavy views
- WebSocket toasts for notifications; sync inbox on reconnect
- Clear offline/online affordances for students
